  "abstract": "This is the third experiment in the \"Parsimony and Mastery\" program. Building upon the Factorized MLP + RC model (ID 232), this submission introduces two more components from the SOTA architecture: LayerNorm on the latent factor forecast and Column Normalization on the U loading matrix. The goal is to isolate and quantify the performance contribution of these normalization techniques.",
